"US-0411: Pipeline stages as LCARS cards (docs/features/epic-04-branding-and-desktop.md). Each pipeline stage becomes a card using the shared .lcars-card style from US-0410: header strip with the stage name, footer with agent or duration and a segmented level bar from the records, current stage lit blue, done grey, skipped muted, mismatch or failure orange, glow following the animations setting."
